QUERY NAME: IntTrade
---------------------------------------------
TYPE: SELECT

SQL:
SELECT DISTINCTROW MonthlyOutput.WorkGroup, Sum(MonthlyOutput.Volume) AS SumOfVolume, Sum([volume]*[unitprice]) AS Expr1
FROM tlkpTestReqmt INNER JOIN MonthlyOutput ON (tlkpTestReqmt.Buyer = MonthlyOutput.Buyer) AND (tlkpTestReqmt.TestCode = MonthlyOutput.TestCode)
WHERE ((tlkpTestReqmt.Buyer Like "int*") AND (MonthlyOutput.Month<4))
GROUP BY MonthlyOutput.WorkGroup;

